	(text "Touch front end (FT5316DME, same controller family as the original MUCA)\n- 21 TX x 12 RX = 252 nodes; any subset can be used (10x10 minimum target). Unused lines can stay open.\n- J3/J4: 1.0 mm FPC (Molex 200528) for printed TPU tails; GND guard on both edges. Route RX away from TX and keep RX short.\n- VDDA and VDD3 on the ferrite-filtered +3.3VA rail; IOVCC on +3V3. VDD5 and VDDD are internal regulators: 1 uF each, close to the pins.\n- R16 holds RST low at power-up (datasheet: reset low before power-on); firmware releases it after the rails are stable.\n- I2C address 0x38, <= 400 kHz. Parts ship blank: flash MuCaFirmware.bin over I2C from the ESP32 before first use.\n- SPI pins (MISO/MOSI) and GPIO7 unused." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 187.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ce737c0d-ffb5-4e58-b2cf-b603cbee21f3"))
